### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/healthz

### Sources summary
GET http://localhost:8000/sources

### Ingest docs
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "runbook-demo",
  "content_type": "docs",
  "text": "HPA scales pods based on CPU or custom metrics...",
  "chunk_size": 800,
  "chunk_overlap": 100
}

### Ingest logs
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source":"k8s-test",
  "content_type":"docs",
  "text":"If metrics-server is missing, HPA will not have CPU metrics and will not scale.",
  "chunk_size":800,
  "chunk_overlap":100
}

### Ask docs only
POST http://localhost:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does HPA scale?",
  "content_type": "docs",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Ask logs only
POST http://localhost:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What could cause a connection reset?",
  "content_type": "logs",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Get costs breakdown
GET http://localhost:8000/costs

### Model hint gpt-4o-mini
POST http://localhost:18000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What does HPA do in Kubernetes?",
    "top_k": 3,
    "model_hint": "gpt-4o-mini"
}
  
### Model hint mock-fast
POST http://localhost:18000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What does HPA do in Kubernetes?",
    "top_k": 3,
    "model_hint": "mock-fast"
}

### Model hint bad-model-name (should fallback to default)
POST http://localhost:18000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What does HPA do in Kubernetes?",
    "top_k": 3,
    "model_hint": "bad-model-name"
}

### Ingest pipeline log with full metadata
POST http://localhost:18000/ingest-log
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "source": "github-actions",
    "repo": "payments-api",
    "pipeline": "deploy",
    "environment": "dev",
    "status": "failed",
    "workflow": "build-and-deploy",
    "service_name": "payments-api",
    "text": "Step 7/10: Deploy to cluster\nkubectl apply -f deploy.yaml\nError from server (BadRequest): container \"api\" in pod \"payments-api\" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image\nBack-off pulling image \"registry.example.com/payments-api:abc123\""
}

### Ask pipeline log with full metadata
POST http://localhost:18000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "Why did this deployment fail and what should I check first?",
    "top_k": 5,
    "source": "github-actions",
    "repo": "payments-api",
    "pipeline": "deploy",
    "environment": "dev",
    "status": "failed",
    "workflow": "build-and-deploy",
    "service_name": "payments-api",
    "analysis_mode": "cicd",
    "model_hint": "gpt-4o-mini"
}